ser cant' easily pipe? Actually qemu-user CAN pipe host stdin directly. The traces failing suggest the harness uses a guest-side file for stdin (dropped from host), and that drop is broken for pure-stdin trace runs (no input_path). Possibly a platform bug: pure via","stream":true,"block":0}

