data: {"seq":91,"ts":"2026-08-23T09:07:39.781Z","text":"main 全貌清楚：UDP 547/546 收 DHCPv6，另有 ctl 控制通道（`dhcp6_ctl_init`→`dhcp6_ctl_acceptcommand`/`dhcp6_ctl_readcommand`），`sys_run_command`(sub_40F0F8) 在 dispatcher 链上。调用图没给 callers，直接读 ctl 命令处理链路函数","stream":true,"block":1}

