earch for functions calling system in httpd.\n\nfw_search \"system\" would return too many. fw_search \"popen\"? Let me search \"exec\" or use the attack surface sink=cmdexec source=network — done, only 2 paths (both bogus). Hmm, so code-graph based","stream":true,"block":0}

