*v5++;` then `v8[i] = 0` — so max 511 chars + NUL = 512 bytes. Exactly fits url[512]. Safe.\n\nOK so that's not a bug (classic IDA split-var artifact). The 3rd token (protocol \"HTTP/1.1\") copy bound 15 into a1+16 area (16 bytes) — safe.\n\nThe chunked/body decode loop with memmove(dest, src, *(a1+112)) — parsing \"Transfer-Encoding: chunked\"? This region (a1","stream":true,"block":0}

