ually which contains the port: dhcp6_ctl_init(addr, port, family, sock). With port=0, it uses DHCP6CTL_PORT. KAME's dhcp6ctl.h: #define DHCP6CTL_PORT 0x0691?? hmm. I remember \"dhcp6ctl\" port 5555 in some implementations; KAME","stream":true,"block":0}

