data: {"seq":709,"ts":"2026-08-23T09:13:18.952Z","text":"Process_upnphttp: buffer is realloc'd to hold everything; sub_40C538 finds \"\\r\\n\\r\\n\" end of headers → a1+44 = header-end offset, a1+40 = content-length (from header). Then sub_40D1FC runs when enough data arrived (a1+36 - a1+44 >= a1+40), or immediately after first recv with the full thing (state0 path).\n\nsub_40D1FC chunked decode:\n- (a1+116)&0x100 → chunked. Then:\n```\nv3 = (a1+32) + (a1+44)  // start of body\ndest = v3\nloop:\n  (a1+112) = strtol(nptr, &src, 16)  // nptr starts at body","stream":true,"block":0}

